  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0.1\n\t  - Initial public release.\n\t  - Inline target-cell editing with auto-managed Modified flag and yellow highlight.\n\t  - Excel export/import using only System.IO.Compression + System.Xml (no ClosedXML / OpenXML SDK).\n\t  - Warning when loading a session against ALL unmanaged metadata.\n\t  - Built-in Help dialog with step-by-step instructions.",
